{"records":[{"participants":["Alice Chen","ACC-100"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-statement-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/statement/line-1"},{"source_id":"a-account-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/account-registry/record-100"}],"summary":"The intake statement reports that Alice Chen is the registered holder of account ACC-100. The account-registry excerpt lists ACC-100 as active and repeats the display name Alice Chen, but does not show the underlying identity-verification result, the date of the last verification, or a provider signature; it is therefore a source assertion rather than independent proof of ownership. The intake statement likewise lacks independent account-provider confirmation and a timestamp for when it was made.","timestamp_text":null},{"participants":["Alice Chen","ACC-100","ACC-200","TX-1"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/transaction-TX-1"}],"summary":"Transaction record TX-1 reports a transfer of USD 500 from ACC-100 to ACC-200 at 2026-01-10 09:00 UTC and names Alice Chen as the initiating user. It identifies the source and destination accounts but contains no field establishing the owner or controller of ACC-200.","timestamp_text":"2026-01-10 09:00 UTC"}]}